Slowness on remotw playing occurs most probably because of the network lag.
Especially if the server is on another continent.
Some machine between the player and the server takes some time to handle
the packets and pass them on.. the more hardware between the server and
the player, the more likely it is that one (or more) of them is overworked
and busy doing something else.

